3714\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe error on iOS and visionOS is:\r\n\r\n```\r\nUndefined symbols for architecture arm64:\r\n  \"_SDL_GetPrefPath\", referenced from:\r\n      _SDL_IOFromFile in libgodot.a[1144](SDL_iostream.ios.template_debug.arm64.o)\r\n```\r\n\r\n- `SDL_IOFromFile` is part of `thirdparty/sdl/io/SDL_iostream.c` and gets compiled\r\n- whereas `SDL_GetPrefPath` is part of `thirdparty/sdl/filesystem/SDL_filesystem.c` and wasn't getting compiled on iOS/visionOS","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-23T01:28:34Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T21:37:16Z","closed_at":"2026-09-23T03:14:58Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"63d408e92f2624bbc82a9178331827509bdd5220","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"oPinon:missingSDLSymbol","ref":"missingSDLSymbol","repo":{"id":1284504448,"node_id":"R_kgDOTI_7gA","name":"godot","full_name":"oPinon/godot","owner":{"login":"oPinon","id":5775700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzU3MDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5775700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oPinon","html_url":"https://github.com/oPinon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oPinon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oPinon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oPinon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oPinon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oPinon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oPinon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oPinon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oPinon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url